            "value" : "متابعة"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Desert Thorn" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a desert shrub covered in sharp thorns.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "شجرة العوسج"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag the flashlight to explore" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اسحب المصباح للاعلى للاستكشاف"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy to find\nThe Desert Thorn is a desert shrub covered in sharp thorns. It may look harsh, but it produces small red berries that birds eat and rely on for food. It reminds us that behind toughness, there can be goodness and beauty for those who are patient." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Desert Thorn plant.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "سهلة الوجود.\nشجيرة صحراوية مليئة بالأشواك. \nتبدو قاسية من الخارج، لكنها تُنتج ثمارًا حمراء صغيرة تأكلها الطيور وتعتمد عليها في غذائها. \nتذكّرنا بأن خلف القسوة قد يوجد خير وجمال لمن يصبر."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eve Tree" : {
      "comment" : "Name of the first item.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "شجرة الحواء"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eve Tree is easy to find.\nIt's a strong tree that grows in the Saudi desert. Despite the intense heat of the sun, it stays green and full of life.\nIt symbolizes hope and feelings that renew and bloom even in the toughest conditions." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Eve Tree item.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "سهل الوجود.\nنبات قوي ينمو في صحراء السعودية. \nرغم حرارة الشمس الشديدة، يبقى أخضر ومليئًا بالحياة. يرمز إلى الأمل والمشاعر التي تتجدد وتزهر حتى في أصعب الظروف."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every item you picked up carries a little story of you, and the items you collected have become a witness to your passage…" : {
      "comment" : "A paragraph describing the significance of the items collected during a journey.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "كل عنصرٍ التقطته يحمل قصةً صغيرة منك، وأصبحت كل العناصر التي جمعتها شاهدةً على عبورك…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
